	(text "FTDI cable order. Pin 4 is the cable TXD,\ninto the Pi RXD. Pin 5 is the cable RXD.\nPin 3 (VCC) stays open: a 5 V cable cannot\nback-feed the Pi. 115200 8N1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 83.82 0)
		(effects
